# deny by default: nothing shares unless whitelisted below
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.workspace.md
!CLAUDE.md
!GEMINI.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!IDEAS.md
# the detailed docs
!docs/
!docs/**
# the agent-facing corpus stays untracked working state (the guides at docs/*.md stay tracked)
/docs/workspace/
# the test material (upstream only)
!tests/
!tests/**
# the test tooling's installed packages stay untracked (the lockfile is tracked)
/tests/node_modules/
# the plugins (tracked catalog: overlays installable into an existing setup)
!plugins/
!plugins/**
# the live workspace state stays untracked in the source: the root drawer and AGENTS.md
/.contexture/
/AGENTS.md
# the base tree: the tracked payload (edit base/, ship, apply to the live drawer)
!base/
!base/**
# the base engine's scratch drawer stays untracked like the live one
base/.contexture/tmp/
# the composed law layer is built at install and boot, never tracked
base/.contexture/laws/AGENTS.generated.md
# local tooling stays untracked
/tools/
